# Texture test: an image-textured globe on a checkered floor, next to a
# principled sphere using the same image as its base color.

image_width  800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 128
max_depth    32
tonemap      aces

camera lookfrom 0 2 9  lookat 0 1 0  vup 0 1 0  vfov 30

texture  earth image ../textures/earthmap.jpg
texture  tiles checker 0.5  0.2 0.3 0.1  0.9 0.9 0.9

material ground lambertian texture tiles
material globe  lambertian texture earth
material shiny  principled texture earth roughness 0.15

sphere  0   -1000 0  1000  ground
sphere -1.2  1    0  1     globe
sphere  1.2  1    0  1     shiny
